[31m-1. What Is a Business Website?[m
[31m-A business website is like a digital office or showroom that is open on the internet. Instead of a customer having to visit the physical premises first, they can use a phone or computer to learn about the business, see products, find contact details and decide whether to make an inquiry.[m
[31m-A digital showroom for precast concrete products.[m
[31m-A place where potential customers learn about the company and its services.[m
[31m-A trusted first point of contact for new customers.[m
[31m-A simple way to direct customers to call, email or request a quotation.[m
[31m-An online presence that can be shared on WhatsApp, social media, business cards and other materials.[m
[31m-   [m
[31m-Simple explanation[m
[31m-"Think of the website as another branch of GAGI SACCO, but this branch is on the internet. A customer can visit it using their phone, see what we sell, learn about the business, find our location and contact us without first coming to the physical premises. The website is built once as a project, while the domain and hosting are the services that keep the website available online. Like a physical branch, the website is most useful when we keep it updated and actively tell customers about it."[m
[31m- [m
[31m-2. How Does the Website Help GAGI SACCO?[m
[31m-It helps customers find the business[m
[31m-A website gives GAGI SACCO an official place on the internet. When connected with Google and other online services, it can help people discover the business when looking for relevant products or services.[m
[31m-It builds trust[m
[31m-A professional website can make a business look organised, established and serious. Customers can see company information, products, location and contact details in one place.[m
[31m-It shows products before a customer visits[m
[31m-Customers can browse products such as cabro blocks, culverts, ventilation blocks, waffle slabs, drains, posts, slabs, copings, channels, building stones, ballast and bollards.[m
[31m-It can bring more inquiries[m
[31m-The website gives customers convenient ways to contact GAGI SACCO, including phone, email, WhatsApp and quotation inquiries.[m
[31m-It works outside business hours[m
[31m-The physical office or yard may close, but the website remains available for customers to learn about the business.[m
[31m-3. How Does a Customer Use the Website?[m
[31m-The customer opens the website using a phone, tablet or computer.[m
[31m-They learn about GAGI SACCO and what the business offers.[m
[31m-They browse the products and information they need.[m
[31m-They check the location and contact details.[m
[31m-They choose an action such as calling, sending a WhatsApp message, sending an email or requesting a quotation.[m
[31m-GAGI SACCO receives the inquiry and communicates with the customer directly.[m
