[31m-8. How Much Does a Business Website Cost?[m
[31m-There is no single price for every website. The price depends on what the business needs.[m
[31m-A simple business website is normally cheaper when it has a small number of pages, mostly informational content, no online shopping system, no customer accounts and simple contact or quotation features.[m
[31m-The price increases when a website requires online payments, customer accounts, ordering systems, large product catalogues, automated systems or a database.[m
[31m-For GAGI SACCO[m
[31m-The current project is primarily a professional business and information website. Its main purpose is to present the company professionally, display products and make it easy for customers to contact GAGI SACCO.[m
