[31m-The website files are placed on the chosen hosting service.[m
[31m-The domain is connected to the hosting service.[m
[31m-The website becomes accessible to customers through the domain.[m
[31m-The business shares the website link on WhatsApp, social media, business cards, quotations and other marketing materials.[m
[31m-The website can be updated when products, contact details, photos or business information change.[m
[31m-The website should be treated as a business asset. It is not something that is built once and forgotten forever. Keeping information current helps maintain trust.[m
[31m-10. What Does the Owner Need to Provide?[m
[31m-Correct business contact details.[m
[31m-Correct physical location and opening hours.[m
[31m-Accurate product information and prices where applicable.[m
[31m-Good quality photographs of products, staff and the premises.[m
[31m-Official business descriptions and important company information.[m
[31m-The preferred domain name.[m
[31m-Access or payment for the domain and hosting account where required.[m
[31m-Approval of website content before final launch.[m
[31m-11. Website Ownership and Access[m
[31m-For long-term business use, the domain and hosting accounts should ideally be registered using business-controlled details and an email address the business can access.[m
[31m-Keep domain login details safe.[m
[31m-Keep hosting login details safe.[m
[31m-Use strong passwords.[m
[31m-Enable extra security where available.[m
[31m-Keep payment and renewal information up to date.[m
[31m-Do not share account passwords unnecessarily.[m
[31m-12. What the Website Cannot Do by Itself[m
[31m-A website is a tool. It can support the business, but it does not automatically guarantee sales.[m
[31m-It does not guarantee that every visitor will become a customer.[m
[31m-It does not automatically put the business at the top of Google.[m
[31m-It does not replace good customer service.[m
[31m-It does not replace advertising and other marketing.[m
[31m-It needs accurate information and occasional updates.[m
[31m-The best results come when the website is combined with good products, good service, active social media, Google visibility and consistent sharing of the website link.[m
