[31m-Add the website link to WhatsApp Business and social media profiles.[m
[31m-Include the website address on business cards and company documents.[m
[31m-Put the website address on quotations and invoices.[m
[31m-Share product pages with customers when answering inquiries.[m
[31m-Direct interested people from social media posts to the website.[m
[31m-Keep the Google Business Profile information accurate and connected to the website.[m
[31m-14. Answers to the Client's Questions[m
[31m-Will the website work on a phone?[m
[31m-Yes. The website is designed to adapt to phones, tablets and computers.[m
[31m-Can customers contact us directly?[m
[31m-Yes. Contact buttons can open WhatsApp, phone calls or email.[m
[31m-Can we change information later?[m
[31m-Yes. Website content can be updated when the business needs changes.[m
[31m-Do we have to pay every year?[m
[31m-The domain and hosting normally require renewal. Website development is a separate project cost.[m
[31m-Will having a website bring customers automatically?[m
[31m-Not automatically. It gives the business a professional online presence and makes it easier for customers to find and contact the business.[m
[31m-Can we add more features later?[m
[31m-Yes. The website can be improved or expanded as the business grows.[m
[31m-Who should control the domain and hosting?[m
[31m-The business should have access to and control of the accounts so the website is not dependent on one person.[m
